<title>ITALY: Italy March wholesale prices rise 0.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Italy March wholesale prices rise 0.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office ISTAT gave the following Italian wholesale price data for March.</p>
<p> WHOLESALE PRICES	 March 97     Feb 97     March 96</p>
<p> Year/Year change	 +0.3 pct   +0.5 pct    +5.6 pct</p>
<p> Month/Month change     -0.2 pct   -0.1 pct     0.0 pct</p>
<p> Index (base 1990 =100)  134.3	 134.6	 133.9</p>
</text>
